{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01T9jJfr2e9BypPY4f1GBMSy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: C3（scale-dependent failure severity）升级为论文核心新颖性。Safety-efficacy\n2\t  gap 成为中心论点：scaling 消除 BCP 破坏性副作用（FM1/FM3）但未改善校准效果。FM2 拆分： politeness arm 保留为命名机制，question_rate\n3\t  arm 降级为 suggestive evidence 并前置 绝对值。FM3 围绕方向一致性重述（the pattern, not the magnitude,\n4\t  is the finding）。 C2 加显式范围限定（observed at 7B; whether DPO-BCP reversal is itself scale-dependent\n5\t  remains open）。摘要从 four failure mechanisms 软化为 three failure mechanisms and one interaction\n6\t  effect。\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: 7B BCP Multi-Run Replication\n9\t  plan_id: plan_005b\n10\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct BCP 额外 3 runs（Run 2-4），每 run 6 variants × 20 tasks。\n11\t    与 mvp-004（Run 1）合计 4 runs × ~480 episodes。将 C1 证据从单次运行提升至 多次运行，直接回应 RC2（variance\n12\t    artifact risk）。\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    run_1_actual:\n15\t      source: mvp-004\n16\t      baseline:\n17\t        politeness: 0.559\n18\t        question_rate: 0.044\n19\t        completion: 0.368\n20\t        n: 19\n21\t      aave:\n22\t        politeness: 0.468\n23\t        question_rate: 0.015\n24\t        completion: 0.1\n25\t        n: 20\n26\t      indian_english:\n27\t        politeness: 0.46\n28\t        question_rate: 0.014\n29\t        completion: 0.15\n30\t        n: 20\n31\t      overcorrected:\n32\t        politeness: 0.605\n33\t        question_rate: 0.018\n34\t        completion: 0.263\n35\t        n: 19\n36\t      single_dim_question:\n37\t        politeness: 0.416\n38\t        question_rate: 0.065\n39\t        completion: 0.25\n40\t        n: 20\n41\t      single_dim_politeness:\n42\t        politeness: 0.634\n43\t        question_rate: 0.021\n44\t        completion: 0.2\n45\t        n: 20\n46\t      h_gate:\n47\t        H1: PASS\n48\t        H2: FAIL\n49\t        H3: FAIL\n50\t    run_2_predicted:\n51\t      baseline:\n52\t        politeness: 0.522\n53\t