{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HBRDAxEKcfsqiFLsqA8vHP","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ACL Rolling Review review form 2025 2026 overall assessment scoring scale 1-5\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform\"},{\"title\":\"ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Reviewer Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ACL ARR 2025 May | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR%2F2025%2FMay\"},{\"title\":\"ACL Rolling Review Data Collection (ARR-DC) - ARR Data Collection\",\"url\":\"https://arr-data.aclweb.org/\"},{\"title\":\"🎪 ACL 2025 Reviews Are Out: To Rebut or Flee? The Harsh Reality of NLP’s \\\"Publish or Perish\\\" Circus | CSPaper Forum\",\"url\":\"https://forum.cspaper.org/topic/27/acl-2025-reviews-are-out-to-rebut-or-flee-the-harsh-reality-of-nlp-s-publish-or-perish-circus\"},{\"title\":\"ACLRollingReview (@ReviewAcl) / Posts / X\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/ReviewAcl\"},{\"title\":\"How ARR works – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewing\"},{\"title\":\"Incentives 2026 – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2026\"},{\"title\":\"ACL ARR 2025 February | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR%2F2025%2FFebruary\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the ACL Rolling Review scoring system:\n\nStarting with February 2025, ARR reviewers are asked to provide three scores: soundness, excitement, and overall recommendation.\n\nHowever, the search results did not provide the specific 1-5 scoring scale details for the overall assessment in the review form. The search results indicate that Overall Assessment descriptions include: 5.0 \"Award-worthy (top 2.5%)\", which suggests a 5-point scale exists, but the complete scoring scale definitions are not fully detailed in these results.\n\nTo get the complete and official review form with the full 1-5 scoring scale for overall assessment, you would want to visit the official ACL Rolling Review website directly at http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e0fab31-3c97-44af-b8df-c308847e2709","uuid":"fb57eba5-8c6b-4655-94cf-5612d060ca90","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:20:45.032Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"ACL Rolling Review review form 2025 2026 overall assessment scoring scale 1-5","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01THDMdHsFdXuDPFNrWibgCg","content":[{"title":"Review Form – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewform"},{"title":"ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/"},{"title":"ARR Reviewer Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/reviewerguidelines"},{"title":"ACL ARR 2025 May | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=aclweb.org%2FACL%2FARR%2F2025%2FMay"},{"title":"ACL Rolling Review Data Collection (ARR-DC) - ARR Data Collection","url":"https://arr-data.aclweb.org/"},{"title":"🎪 ACL 2025 Reviews Are Out: To Rebut or Flee? The Harsh Reality of NLP’s \"Publish or Perish\" Circus 