n6. **Generalizability of claims**: The abstract says \"our taxonomy provides actionable constraints for future calibration research\" but all evidence is from one model family on one benchmark. How generalizable are the findings?\n\nOutput your review in this format:\n\n```\n## R2 Review: Novelty and Related Work\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Weaknesses\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Minor Issues\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Scores\n- Soundness: X/5\n- Excitement: X/5\n- Overall: X/5\n- Confidence: X/5\n\n### Detailed Assessment\n[2-3 paragraphs on novelty/related work quality]\n```\n","uuid":"b24da7f0-b8ae-4b39-8ee1-c4922bd8a5f7","session_id":"2e0fab31-3c97-44af-b8df-c308847e2709"}
