h\" but all evidence is from one model family on one benchmark. How generalizable are the findings?\n\nOutput your review in this format:\n\n```\n## R2 Review: Novelty and Related Work\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Weaknesses\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Questions for Authors\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Minor Issues\n[Numbered list]\n\n### Scores\n- Soundness: X/5\n- Excitement: X/5\n- Overall: X/5\n- Confidence: X/5\n\n### Detailed Assessment\n[2-3 paragraphs on novelty/related work quality]\n```\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01EMzjXQYSrSW32TNMFn3MVt","session_id":"2e0fab31-3c97-44af-b8df-c308847e2709","uuid":"bc49c964-baa4-4c42-9fbb-80599f2d26c8","timestamp":"2026-05-13T16:22:09.413Z"}
